        "rarity": "RARE",
        "artist": "Raymond Swanland",
        "flavorText": "\"There is no place like a rooftop laboratory in a lightning storm. It's where genius strikes.\"\n—Renna, Selhoff alchemist",
        "imageUri": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/5/2/5294d359-c599-40ed-9e06-2a3cc8624d6a.jpg?1783937750",
